cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use recap in your research, please cite it as below. recap is under development and has
  not been published yet; results should be checked against manual counts before they are reported.
title: "recap: Reconstruction of Cellular Architecture and Phenotypes"
abstract: >-
  Nuclear segmentation, counting and HSV-1 infection scoring (VRC+ / VRC-) for fluorescence images
  of neural tissue (DAPI and a viral replication compartment marker such as ICP8), with manual
  counting, per-batch and per-image settings, tuning and model training against corrected masks.
  Developed with test images, manual counts and biological guidance from Leonardo D'Aiuto.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Shane
    family-names: Buckley
version: 4.3.0
license: MIT
keywords:
  - nuclear segmentation
  - HSV-1
  - viral replication compartments
  - fluorescence microscopy
  - StarDist
  - napari
